WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:00.367
Understand

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:02.402
you were granted exclusive access

00:00:02.702 --> 00:00:03.603
to the largest

00:00:03.603 --> 00:00:05.739
ever joint military exercise

00:00:06.006 --> 00:00:07.774
between the United States and Israel.

00:00:07.774 --> 00:00:09.342
Tell us about that

00:00:10.143 --> 00:00:12.579
Yeah, this joint weeklong exercise dubbed

00:00:12.579 --> 00:00:13.580
Junior Juniper

00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:15.015
Oak, is unprecedented

00:00:15.015 --> 00:00:16.683
in its scale and size

00:00:16.683 --> 00:00:18.385
and among its target audiences

00:00:18.385 --> 00:00:21.988
for the messaging is Iran

00:00:23.723 --> 00:00:25.925
CNN granted exclusive access

00:00:25.925 --> 00:00:28.128
to the danger zone on the super carrier

00:00:28.128 --> 00:00:29.763
USS George H.W.

00:00:29.763 --> 00:00:30.930
Bush to see

00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:31.865
part of the largest

00:00:31.865 --> 00:00:33.033
ever American

00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:35.535
and Israeli joint military exercise,

00:00:36.036 --> 00:00:38.038
covering all aspects of warfare

00:00:38.038 --> 00:00:39.572
from the air

00:00:39.906 --> 00:00:41.341
on land

00:00:43.143 --> 00:00:44.577
to the sea,

00:00:44.978 --> 00:00:47.147
online and even in space.

00:00:47.914 --> 00:00:49.616
The timing is no accident

00:00:49.616 --> 00:00:51.851
meant to send a clear signal to Iran

00:00:52.052 --> 00:00:54.154
and other adversaries in the region

00:00:54.154 --> 00:00:55.221
that despite the attention

00:00:55.221 --> 00:00:56.623
on Ukraine and U.S.

00:00:56.623 --> 00:00:57.957
concerns over the new right

00:00:57.957 --> 00:00:59.392
wing Israeli government,

00:00:59.392 --> 00:01:00.093
the Americans

00:01:00.093 --> 00:01:01.261
remain deeply aligned

00:01:01.261 --> 00:01:03.296
and committed to a military partnership

00:01:03.296 --> 00:01:04.531
with Israel

00:01:04.531 --> 00:01:06.332
for the Americans and the Israelis.

00:01:06.332 --> 00:01:07.700
These types of exercises

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:09.035
are a show of force,

00:01:09.035 --> 00:01:10.470
a show of partnership,

00:01:10.470 --> 00:01:11.771
and a way for the both of them

00:01:11.771 --> 00:01:12.705
to show the world

00:01:12.705 --> 00:01:14.007
that they can walk and chew

00:01:14.007 --> 00:01:15.408
gum at the same time.

00:01:18.211 --> 00:01:19.813
Only through a firm commitment

00:01:19.813 --> 00:01:21.347
to this partnership

00:01:21.347 --> 00:01:23.483
are we able to plan and organize

00:01:23.783 --> 00:01:25.752
such an incredibly complex,

00:01:25.752 --> 00:01:27.420
high end operation.

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:29.222
With so many elements across

00:01:29.222 --> 00:01:31.324
such a large geographic area

00:01:31.324 --> 00:01:33.726
against all aspects of war fighting,

00:01:33.726 --> 00:01:35.328
some of which are seen,

00:01:35.328 --> 00:01:35.695
some of

00:01:35.695 --> 00:01:37.564
which are not for the Israelis,

00:01:37.564 --> 00:01:39.065
the exercise is crucial.

00:01:39.065 --> 00:01:39.899
They've long opposed

00:01:39.899 --> 00:01:41.801
a return to the Iranian nuclear deal

00:01:41.801 --> 00:01:42.435
and have argued

00:01:42.435 --> 00:01:43.970
that a credible military threat

00:01:43.970 --> 00:01:46.172
needs to be on the table to deter Iran

00:01:46.239 --> 00:01:48.308
from fully developing a nuclear weapon.

00:01:48.575 --> 00:01:52.378
Israel and the US share the same values

00:01:53.246 --> 00:01:56.116
the IDF and the US CENTCOM

00:01:56.583 --> 00:02:00.720
see eye to eye the threats on this area.

00:02:01.187 --> 00:02:03.990
More than 6400 American personnel joined

00:02:03.990 --> 00:02:07.060
1100 Israelis as part of the exercises

00:02:07.327 --> 00:02:08.161
that utilize

00:02:08.161 --> 00:02:10.330
more than 142 aircraft,

00:02:10.330 --> 00:02:12.332
including these F-18s.

00:02:12.332 --> 00:02:13.366
And while the Israelis

00:02:13.366 --> 00:02:14.067
and Americans

00:02:14.067 --> 00:02:16.169
regularly carry out joint exercises

00:02:16.503 --> 00:02:18.004
this one shifted the focus

00:02:18.004 --> 00:02:19.305
more on the offensive

00:02:19.305 --> 00:02:21.574
rather than just defensive capabilities.

00:02:21.975 --> 00:02:24.177
It also came together in just two months,

00:02:24.177 --> 00:02:25.411
incredibly quickly,

00:02:25.411 --> 00:02:27.347
especially for something of this scale

00:02:27.347 --> 00:02:28.715
compared to the typical year

00:02:28.715 --> 00:02:30.283
or so of planning.

00:02:30.283 --> 00:02:31.751
While officials shy away

00:02:31.751 --> 00:02:33.386
from drawing a direct connection

00:02:33.386 --> 00:02:34.320
between the speed

00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:36.022
and recent events in Iran,

00:02:36.022 --> 00:02:36.789
and the breakdown

00:02:36.789 --> 00:02:38.324
last year of negotiations

00:02:38.324 --> 00:02:39.659
over the nuclear deal,

00:02:39.659 --> 00:02:41.794
it is hard to ignore the context.

00:02:42.328 --> 00:02:43.496
I think it's fairly clear

00:02:43.496 --> 00:02:45.031
that we can very quickly

00:02:45.031 --> 00:02:45.632
move assets

00:02:45.632 --> 00:02:47.433
in the region to respond to crises,

00:02:47.433 --> 00:02:49.802
and we can do so alongside our partners,

00:02:49.802 --> 00:02:50.670
and we can fight

00:02:50.670 --> 00:02:52.572
and conduct offensive operations

00:02:52.572 --> 00:02:54.541
in every domain alongside our partners.

00:02:54.541 --> 00:02:55.542
The military option

00:02:55.542 --> 00:02:56.643
which President Biden

00:02:56.643 --> 00:02:58.711
called the last resort to deal with Iran,

00:02:59.012 --> 00:03:01.047
seems to be on loud display

00:03:04.217 --> 00:03:04.751
Wolf.

00:03:04.751 --> 00:03:05.118
More than

00:03:05.118 --> 00:03:08.454
£180,000 of live munitions

00:03:08.454 --> 00:03:10.123
were used during this exercise.

00:03:10.123 --> 00:03:11.057
And one thing that officials

00:03:11.057 --> 00:03:12.225
I spoke to today

00:03:12.225 --> 00:03:12.892
pointed out to me

00:03:12.892 --> 00:03:13.993
that was especially for them,

00:03:13.993 --> 00:03:15.395
exciting and interesting about

00:03:15.395 --> 00:03:16.329
this exercise

00:03:16.329 --> 00:03:17.363
was really how it covered

00:03:17.363 --> 00:03:18.364
absolutely all

00:03:18.364 --> 00:03:20.433
aspects of modern warfare

00:03:20.433 --> 00:03:22.669
from the typical planes and boats

00:03:22.702 --> 00:03:23.836
and on the ground,

00:03:23.836 --> 00:03:25.572
but also including cyber warfare.

00:03:25.572 --> 00:03:27.740
And this time they said space.

00:03:27.740 --> 00:03:29.042
Wolf. Very important.

00:03:29.042 --> 00:03:30.143
Excellent reporting. I had to ask.

00:03:30.143 --> 00:03:31.177
Thank you very much.

00:03:31.177 --> 00:03:33.279
In a very significant signal

00:03:33.313 --> 00:03:35.014
message to the Iranians right now.

00:03:35.014 --> 00:03:36.649
That was the intent I got.

00:03:36.649 --> 00:03:37.717
Thank you very, very much.

